{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"30":"Chapters on Drinks"},"section_detail":{"30":{"hadithnumber_first":3371,"hadithnumber_last":3435,"arabicnumber_first":3371,"arabicnumber_last":3435,"name_native":"كتاب الأشربة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3428,"arabicnumber":3428,"text":"حدثنا بكر بن خلف ابو بشر، حدثنا يزيد بن زريع، عن خالد الحذاء، عن عكرمة، عن ابن عباس، قال نهى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم عن التنفس في الاناء","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":30,"hadith":58}}]}